  "description": "Backend-reflecting API for the Moesif analytics body-capture, header-redaction, sampling and retry-queue scenarios. Every operation targets a node-customer-service reflect route, so the response body echoes the request body and the assertion can compare what the backend received against what Moesif was told.",
